<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="mn">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Боловсролын Платформ — 3D Motion</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;800&family=Noto+Serif+Mongolian:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Sans+Mongolian:wght@300;400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.12.5/dist/gsap.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.12.5/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@studio-freight/lenis@1.0.42/dist/lenis.min.js"></script>
<style>
:root{--ink:#0a0a0a;--ink-soft:#181818;--ink-faint:#555;--surface:#f8f6f2;--paper:#fff;--accent:#2c3e50;--warm:#8b734b;--gold:#c4b49a;--radius:2rem;--font-display:"Playfair Display","Noto Serif Mongolian",Georgia,serif;--font-body:"Inter","Noto Sans Mongolian",system-ui,sans-serif;}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:88px}
body{font-family:var(--font-body);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.55;letter-spacing:-0.01em;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
::selection{background:rgba(44,62,80,0.12);color:inherit}

/* ---------- HEADER ---------- */
.site-header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.82);backdrop-filter:saturate(140%) blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:saturate(140%) blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);transition:box-shadow .3s ease,background .3s ease}
.site-header.scrolled{box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.95)}
.header-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2rem;height:80px;padding:0 3vw;max-width:1400px;margin:0 auto}
.logo{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-0.035em;text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;transition:opacity .2s}
.logo:hover{opacity:.7}.logo-mark{font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--warm);line-height:1}
.main-nav{flex:1;display:flex;justify-content:center}
.nav-list{list-style:none;display:flex;gap:2.5rem}
.nav-list a{font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:500;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--ink-faint);letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;position:relative;padding:.15rem 0;transition:color .2s}
.nav-list a::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:-2px;width:0;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--gold));border-radius:1px;transition:width .25s ease,left .25s ease}
.nav-list a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.nav-list a:hover::after{width:100%;left:0}
.search-form{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);border-radius:999px;padding:.35rem .9rem;flex:1;max-width:260px;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.search-form:focus-within{border-color:rgba(44,62,80,0.3);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(44,62,80,0.08)}
.search-form input{background:transparent;border:none;outline:none;color:var(--ink);font-family:inherit;font-size:.85rem;width:100%;padding:.25rem 0}
.search-form button{background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:.2rem;color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:1rem}
.auth-actions{display:flex;gap:.6rem}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.4rem;padding:.65rem 1.4rem;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:.01em;border:1.5px solid transparent;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .08s,box-shadow .25s,background .2s,border-color .2s;line-height:1.25;text-decoration:none}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}
.btn:active{transform:translateY(0)}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.12)}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-deep);background:rgba(44,62,80,0.05)}
.btn-primary{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(10,10,10,0.12)}
.btn-primary:hover{background:#152838;border-color:#152838;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(10,10,10,0.18)}
.btn-large{padding:.95rem 2rem;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.02em}
.menu-btn{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;background:none;border:none;padding:.4rem;cursor:pointer}
.menu-btn span{display:block;width:24px;height:1.5px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:1px;transition:.2s ease;transform-origin:center}
.menu-btn[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(6.5px) rotate(45deg)}
.menu-btn[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}
.menu-btn[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-6.5px) rotate(-45deg)}

/* ---------- HERO ---------- */
.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#0f1115;padding:10rem 0 9rem;isolation:isolate}
.hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:-20%;left:-10%;width:70vw;height:70vw;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,rgba(196,180,154,0.12),transparent 60%);border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;animation:heroOrb 12s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
.hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;bottom:-15%;right:-10%;width:60vw;height:60vw;background:radial-gradient(circle at 70% 70%,rgba(44,62,80,0.15),transparent 60%);border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;animation:heroOrb2 14s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
@keyframes heroOrb{from{transform:translate(0,0)}to{transform:translate(40px,-30px)}}
@keyframes heroOrb2{from{transform:translate(0,0)}to{transform:translate(-30px,20px)}}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 0.95fr;gap:4rem;align-items:center;position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 3vw}
.hero-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(3.5rem,7vw,6rem);font-weight:700;line-height:1.05;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-0.05em;margin:0 0 1.5rem;word-break:keep-all}
.hero-title .accent{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),#e8cfa6);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;position:relative}
.hero-title .accent::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:-0.08em;right:-0.08em;bottom:0.08em;height:0.18em;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),#e8cfa6);opacity:.35;border-radius:2px;z-index:-1}
.hero-sub{font-size:1.15rem;color:#aaa;max-width:460px;margin:0 0 2.5rem;line-height:1.65;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
.hero-cta{display:flex;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero-visual{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:380px;perspective:1200px}

/* ---------- 3D CUBE (Modern) ---------- */
.cube-stage{width:260px;height:260px;position:relative;transform-style:preserve-3d;perspective:1400px;animation:cubeFloat 6s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes cubeFloat{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-15px)}}
.cube{width:100%;height:100%;position:relative;transform-style:preserve-3d;transform:rotateY(-20deg) rotateX(12deg);transition:transform .7s ease}
.cube:hover{transform:rotateY(-10deg) rotateX(5deg) scale(1.05)}
.face{position:absolute;width:220px;height:220px;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.08),rgba(196,180,154,0.08));border-radius:2rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:3.5rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);box-shadow:inset 0 0 60px rgba(255,255,255,0.05),0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);backdrop-filter:blur(2px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(2px);transition:background .3s,box-shadow .3s}
.face:hover{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.15),rgba(196,180,154,0.15));box-shadow:inset 0 0 80px rgba(255,255,255,0.1),0 40px 100px rgba(0,0,0,0.45)}
.face-front{transform:translateZ(110px)}
.face-back{transform:rotateY(180deg) translateZ(110px)}
.face-right{transform:rotateY(90deg) translateZ(110px)}
.face-left{transform:rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(110px)}
.face-top{transform:rotateX(90deg) translateZ(110px)}
.face-bottom{transform:rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(110px)}

/* ---------- SECTIONS ---------- */
section{padding:6rem 0;position:relative}
.section-heading{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 3.5rem;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.15;display:inline-block;position:relative}
.section-heading::after{content:"";display:block;width:3.5rem;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--gold));border-radius:3px;margin-top:.75rem;opacity:.8}
.container{width:min(92%,1200px);margin-inline:auto}

/* Categories */
.categories{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,#f5f2ec 100%);border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);position:relative}
.categories::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:120px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.9),transparent);pointer-events:none;z-index:1}
.category-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;position:relative;z-index:2}
.category-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.5rem;transition:transform .25s var(--ease-editorial),box-shadow .3s ease,border-color .2s ease;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);position:relative;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none}
.category-card::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--gold));opacity:.7;transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .3s ease;border-radius:3px 3px 0 0}
.category-card:hover{transform:translateY(-8px);box-shadow:0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.12)}
.category-card:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1)}
.category-card .cat-icon{font-size:2.2rem;line-height:1;color:var(--accent);transition:transform .3s var(--ease-bounce)}
.category-card:hover .cat-icon{transform:scale(1.2) rotate(-6deg)}
.category-card h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.2rem;margin:0;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-0.02em}
.category-card p{margin:0;color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:.9rem;font-weight:300}

/* Materials */
.materials{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f5f2ec 0%,#fff 100%);position:relative}
.materials-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:1.5rem}
.material-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;transition:transform .25s var(--ease-editorial),box-shadow .3s ease;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);position:relative;text-decoration:none;display:block}
.material-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.12)}
.material-thumb{height:170px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2c3e50,#1a2530);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:3rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:background .3s ease}
.material-thumb::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,rgba(255,255,255,.08),transparent 70%)}
.material-card:hover .material-thumb{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3d5a7a,#2c3e50)}
.material-card h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.15rem;margin:1.25rem 1.25rem .35rem;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-0.02em}
.material-card p{margin:0 1.25rem .25rem;color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.55;font-weight:300}
.material-card .btn-sm{margin:0.5rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;display:inline-flex}

/* Progress */
.progress{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a2530,#2c3e50);color:#fff;padding:6rem 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.progress::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:-30%;right:-10%;width:60vw;height:60vw;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%,rgba(196,180,154,.08),transparent 60%);border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none}
.progress-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4rem;align-items:center;position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 3vw}
.progress-text h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.2rem,3.5vw,3rem);font-weight:700;margin:0 0 1rem;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.15;color:#fff}
.progress-text>p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);font-size:1.05rem;max-width:420px;line-height:1.65;font-weight:300;margin:0 0 2rem}
.stats-row{display:flex;gap:3rem;margin-top:2rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.stat{text-align:left}
.stat strong{display:block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:2.4rem;color:#fff;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.03em}
.stat span{display:block;font-size:.85rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);margin-top:.35rem;letter-spacing:.01em}
.progress-visual{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative}
.progress-chart{width:100%;max-width:420px;height:auto;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);filter:drop-shadow(0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.3))}

/* Footer */
.site-footer{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0a0a0a,#111);color:#eaeaea;padding:4rem 0 1.5rem;position:relative}
.site-footer::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(196,180,154,.3),transparent)}
.footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:3rem;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 3vw}
.footer-brand a{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;color:#fff;font-size:1.3rem;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;letter-spacing:-0.03em;text-decoration:none;transition:opacity .2s}
.footer-brand a:hover{opacity:.75}
.footer-brand p{margin:.75rem 0 0;color:rgba(255,255,255,.45);font-size:.9rem;max-width:320px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:300}
.footer-nav h4{color:#fff;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1rem;margin:0 0 .75rem;letter-spacing:.02em}
.footer-nav ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}
.footer-nav li+li{margin-top:.35rem}
.footer-nav a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:.85rem;text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s;letter-spacing:.01em}
.footer-nav a:hover{color:#fff}
.footer-social{display:flex;gap:.75rem}
.footer-social a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#fff;font-size:1.05rem;text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s,transform .15s,border-color .2s;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
.footer-social a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.15)}
.footer-bottom{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);padding-top:1rem;margin-top:3rem;font-size:.82rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);letter-spacing:.01em;max-width:1200px;margin-inline:auto;padding-inline:3vw}

/* Dialogs */
dialog{border:none;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:0;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 24px 80px rgba(10,10,10,.15);max-width:420px;width:min(92%,420px);font-family:var(--font-body)}
dialog::backdrop{background:rgba(10,10,10,.4);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}
dialog form{padding:2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem}
dialog h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 .25rem;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-.03em}
dialog label{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-muted);letter-spacing:.01em}
dialog input{padding:.75rem .9rem;border:1.5px solid rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);font-family:inherit;font-size:.9rem;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s;background:#f8f6f2;color:var(--ink)}
dialog input:focus{border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(44,62,80,.08)}
dialog button{margin-top:.25rem}
.toast{position:fixed;bottom:2rem;right:2rem;z-index:200;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:.85rem 1.25rem;border-radius:var(--radius-xs);box-shadow:var(--shadow-hover);font-weight:500;font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:.9rem;letter-spacing:.01em;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .35s ease,transform .35s ease;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);pointer-events:auto}
.btn-back-top{position:fixed;bottom:1.5rem;right:1.5rem;z-index:150;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border:none;font-size:1.2rem;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.2);opacity:.9;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s,box-shadow .2s;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-display)}
.btn-back-top:hover{opacity:1;transform:translateY(-3px) scale(1.08);box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}

/* Responsive */
@media(max-width:1024px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:3rem;text-align:center}.hero-cta{justify-content:center}.hero-visual{min-height:300px}.progress-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:3rem}.stats-row{justify-content:flex-start}.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(max-width:768px){.header-inner{gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;height:auto;padding:.75rem 0}.search-form{max-width:100%;order:3;flex-basis:100%}.auth-actions{order:2}.nav-list{display:none;position:absolute;top:calc(80px + .5rem);left:0;right:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,.98);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);padding:.75rem 1rem;flex-direction:column;gap:.75rem;box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.08);z-index:99;border-radius:0 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm)}.nav-list.open{display:flex}.menu-btn{display:flex;order:2}.hero{padding:6rem 0 5rem}.category-grid,.materials-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.section-heading{font-size:2rem}.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.cube-stage{width:200px;height:200px}.face{width:180px;height:180px}.face-front{transform:translateZ(90px)}.face-back{transform:rotateY(180deg) translateZ(90px)}.face-right{transform:rotateY(90deg) translateZ(90px)}.face-left{transform:rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(90px)}.face-top{transform:rotateX(90deg) translateZ(90px)}.face-bottom{transform:rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(90px)}}
@media(max-width:480px){.hero-title{font-size:2.8rem}.stats-row{gap:1.5rem;justify-content:center}.material-thumb{height:120px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<a href="#main" class="skip-link">Үндсэн агуулга руу</a>

<header class="site-header" role="banner" id="siteHeader">
<div class="header-inner">
<a href="#" class="logo" aria-label="Боловсролын Платформ — Нүүр хуудас"><span class="logo-mark" aria-hidden="true">◈</span><span class="logo-text">Боловсролын Платформ</span></a>
<nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Үндсэн навигаци" role="navigation">
<button id="menuBtn" class="menu-btn" aria-label="Нэвтрэх цэс" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mainNavList"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
<ul id="mainNavList" class="nav-list" role="menubar">
<li role="none"><a href="#hero" role="menuitem">Нүүр</a></li>
<li role="none"><a href="#categories" role="menuitem">Хичээл</a></li>
<li role="none"><a href="#materials" role="menuitem">Сурах бичиг</a></li>
<li role="none"><a href="#progress" role="menuitem">Ахиц</a></li>
</ul>
</nav>
<form class="search-form" role="search" aria-label="Хичээл хайх" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); filterLessons(this.querySelector('input').value);">
<label for="searchInput" class="sr-only">Хичээл хайх</label>
<input id="searchInput" type="text" placeholder="Хичээл хайх…" autocomplete="off" aria-live="polite"/>
<button type="submit" aria-label="Хайх"><span aria-hidden="true">🔍</span></button>
</form>
<div class="auth-actions" aria-label="Нэвтрэх, бүртгүүлэх">
<button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="openLogin()">Нэвтрэх</button>
<button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openRegister()">Бүртгүүлэх</button>
</div>
</div>
</header>

<main id="main" role="main">
<!-- Hero -->
<section id="hero" class="hero" aria-label="Платформын танилцуулга">
<div class="container hero-grid">
<div class="hero-text">
<h1 class="hero-title">Онлайн хичээл, сурах бичиг<br><span class="accent">нэг дор</span></h1>
<p class="hero-sub">Монголын сурагчдад зориулсан орчин үеийн боловсролын платформ. Хичээл үз, сурах бичиг нээ, ахиц хяна — бүгд нэг дор.</p>
<div class="hero-cta">
<a href="#categories" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Хичээл үзэх</a>
<a href="#materials" class="btn btn-ghost btn-large" style="color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.25);background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);">Сурах бичиг</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
